1334 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Corporate website\072 headless CMS\n\nFrontend Developer \267 06\0562026 \023 10\0562026\n\nRebuild of a company\047s public website\056 WordPress serves as the content backend\054 a Next\056js application renders the site\054 and pages update automatically when editors publish\056\nBuilt 10\053 service landing pages on Next\056js 15 \050App Router\051\054 React 19 and Tailwind CSS 4\056\nCreated 20\053 reusable page sections\072 FAQ blocks with SEO markup\054 tabs\054 case cards and blog listings\054 with responsive and mobile layouts\056\nSet up tag\055based incremental static regeneration\054 triggered by WordPress webhooks when a post or a navigation menu is updated\056\nFixed a production issue where menu requests returned HTML error pages from the CDN and broke JSON parsing\056 Added content\055type checks and retries with backoff\056\nDeveloped custom Gutenberg blocks with ACF\054 including a case\055study block with a metrics table\056\nConnected contact and subscription forms using Cloudflare Turnstile verification and Nodemailer\056\nFixed a Docker build that hung at the lint and typecheck stages of the CI pipeline\054 noticeably reducing build time\056\n\nStack\072 TypeScript\054 Next\056js\054 React\054 Tailwind CSS\054 Radix UI\054 Framer Motion\054 WordPress \050headless\054 ACF\054 Gutenberg\051\054 PHP\054 Nodemailer\054 Cloudflare Turnstile\054 Docker\054 Bitbucket Pipelines\056)
     /K [ 30 ]
     /P 1335 0 R
     /Pg 1274 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

