1336 0 obj
  << /ActualText (HR tech\072 AI\055assisted candidate evaluation\n\nFull Stack Developer \267 02\0562026 \023 09\0562026\n\nA system that analyses interview transcripts and candidate CVs\054 scores candidates against client requirements and posts the resulting report back into the hiring workflow\056 Over the project it processed 100\053 vacancies and candidates\056\nMain developer of the product\072 built the Fastify API\054 the background workers and the React frontend\056\nImplemented the analysis pipeline\072 PDF CV parsing\054 extraction of work history\054 consistency checks between the CV and the interview\054 and LLM scoring against client requirements\056 A full analysis is generated in 30\02360 seconds\056\nAdded a RAG pipeline on Qdrant with OpenAI embeddings to find similar past candidates\054 so each evaluation is based on historical hiring data\056\nIntegrated Linear through its SDK and webhooks\072 analysis starts when a ticket receives new data\054 and the report is posted back as a comment\056\nMoved long LLM calls out of the request cycle into BullMQ and Redis\054 with three separate workers for analysis\054 CV consistency and interview preparation\056\nBuilt the API with JWT authentication\054 rate limiting and file upload\054 validating all endpoints with shared Zod schemas\056\nDeveloped the frontend with TanStack Router\054 Query and Table\054 shadcn\057ui\054 Recharts dashboards and a Tiptap editor for editing reports\056\nSet up PostgreSQL \050Prisma\051\054 Qdrant and Redis in Docker Compose\054 deployed the frontend on Render and exposed the backend through a Cloudflare Tunnel\056\n\nStack\072 TypeScript\054 Node\056js\054 Fastify\054 Prisma\054 BullMQ\054 Zod\054 OpenAI API\054 Qdrant\054 PostgreSQL\054 Redis\054 React\054 Vite\054 TanStack\054 Tailwind CSS\054 shadcn\057ui\054 Docker\054 Render\054 Cloudflare\056)
     /K [ 31 ]
     /P 1337 0 R
     /Pg 1274 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

