1338 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Productivity software\072 desktop meeting recorder with AI search\n\nFrontend Developer \267 07\0562026 \023 09\0562026\n\nA local\055first desktop application for recording meetings and asking questions about them in natural language\056 Answers cite sources\054 and each citation plays back the exact moment in the recording\056\nBuilt the main screens\072 meeting page\054 transcript tab\054 interaction statistics\054 audio player with waveform and meeting export\056\nImplemented the settings area \050privacy\054 notifications\054 personal mentions\054 profile and password change\051 and the first\055run setup wizard\056\nWorked with a local RAG store on SQLite and sqlite\055vec that combines full\055text and vector search over transcripts\056\nManaged state with Zustand\054 localized the app into English and Russian with react\055i18next\054 and covered transcript utilities with unit tests\056\n\nStack\072 TypeScript\054 React\054 Vite\054 Tauri\054 Zustand\054 Radix UI\054 React Hook Form\054 react\055i18next\054 SQLite\054 sqlite\055 vec\056)
     /K [ 32 ]
     /P 1339 0 R
     /Pg 1274 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
