1340 0 obj
  << /ActualText (E\055commerce SaaS\072 tools for 3D\055printing sellers\n\nFull Stack Developer \267 04\0562026 \023 07\0562026\n\nA subscription platform for 3D\055printing sellers\072 parametric model configurators that run in the browser\054 plus AI\055assisted marketplace listings and product mockups\056\nBuilt five 3D model configurators with real\055time preview on Three\056js and React Three Fiber\054 assembling printable models from a library of 350\053 STL parts\056 Each configurator includes text handling \050fonts\054 spacing\051\054 drag\055and\055drop in the viewer and processing of the 3D mesh\056\nMoved CSG geometry operations into Web Workers using manifold\0553d \050WebAssembly\051 so the interface stays responsive during mesh generation\056 Configured the Next\056js build for async WebAssembly\056\nWrote client\055side geometry utilities\072 text\055to\055cross\055section generation from TTF fonts\054 a binary STL parser and multi\055part 3MF assembly\056\nDeveloped NestJS endpoints for server\055side model assembly\054 using a Piscina worker\055thread pool for heavy operations and S3 for storing results\056\nReplaced fragile filename parsing with a dedicated part\055resolver service\054 which removed a class of silent 404 errors across 350\053 assets\056\nIntegrated OpenAI behind provider interfaces for marketplace listings and mockup generation\056 A listing with an image is generated in about 30 seconds\054 and the tools I implemented have handled 1\054000\053 generations in total\056\nBuilt the landing and pricing pages\056\n\nStack\072 TypeScript\054 Next\056js\054 React\054 Three\056js\054 React Three Fiber\054 WebAssembly\054 Web Workers\054 NestJS\054 Prisma\054 PostgreSQL\054 AWS \050Cognito\054 S3\054 CloudFront\051\054 OpenAI API\054 Stripe\054 PayPal\054 Docker\056)
     /K [ 33 ]
     /P 1341 0 R
     /Pg 1274 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

